			description: [
				"Something was meant to be here, but I can't seem to remember."
				""
				"This story that seems similar yet foreign, remembered but also forgotten, is burning a hole in my head."
				"If I keep establishing myself in this world, I should be able to find a starting point for this story."
				""
				"These headaches have gotten unbearably loud."
			]
